WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.260 --> 00:00:05.349
Devil fruits have a will of their own that
can be inherited through the generations,

00:00:05.349 --> 00:00:10.250
which is exactly why the Gomu Gomu no Mi is
so important.

00:00:10.250 --> 00:00:15.730
Now same as me, you probably have been very
focused on Haki for the past couple of years,

00:00:15.730 --> 00:00:17.650
which just makes sense.

00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:23.560
This may sound harsh, but Devil fruits simply
were not that interesting for a while.

00:00:23.560 --> 00:00:28.440
Until Doflamingo revealed the next level:
Awakening.

00:00:28.440 --> 00:00:34.780
And, minor spoiler, since this topic has become
relevant again in recent chapters with the

00:00:34.780 --> 00:00:41.020
revealed awakenings of Kid and Law, I couldn't
help but wonder: Has Luffy awakened his Devil

00:00:41.020 --> 00:00:42.020
Fruit as well?

00:00:42.020 --> 00:00:43.620
And what would it actually look like?

00:00:43.620 --> 00:00:49.649
And most importantly, what is the secret behind
them?

00:00:49.649 --> 00:00:52.910
For the first time in a while that really
got me thinking.

00:00:52.910 --> 00:00:56.519
To the point where I was lying in bed at night,
unable to sleep.

00:00:56.519 --> 00:01:02.039
My analytical brain shifting into overtime
gear, told me that there had to be some clues

00:01:02.039 --> 00:01:03.039
in the story.

00:01:03.039 --> 00:01:05.110
I just HAD to find out what the true nature
of devil fruits truly was.

00:01:05.110 --> 00:01:06.320
So what did I do?

00:01:06.320 --> 00:01:10.971
Well, what any reasonable person would do
at 4am in the morning, I got up, opened my

00:01:10.971 --> 00:01:13.190
laptop and started working.

00:01:13.190 --> 00:01:19.320
I was gonna analyze every type of fruit, every
type of fruit and every instance of awakening

00:01:19.320 --> 00:01:26.060
until a few hours later, I actually completed
this crazy puzzle of clues, that connects

00:01:26.060 --> 00:01:27.930
Luffy, Roger and Joy Boy.

00:01:27.930 --> 00:01:30.450
But I'm getting ahead of myself here.

00:01:30.450 --> 00:01:35.510
Hi my name is Manu, my favorite fruit is pineapple,
and in this video I will pull back the curtain

00:01:35.510 --> 00:01:39.350
for you on the true nature of devil fruits.

00:01:39.350 --> 00:01:42.460
Because the devil truly lies in the details
here.

00:01:42.460 --> 00:01:47.640
The first thing I did, as I usually do with
any theoretical analysis, was to establish

00:01:47.640 --> 00:01:48.890
the facts.

00:01:48.890 --> 00:01:50.550
What do we actually know.

00:01:50.550 --> 00:01:54.500
And even though you're probably already familiar
with this, it's gonna be critical for the

00:01:54.500 --> 00:01:59.420
juicy bit later on and let's be real, there
are definitely less fun things than learning

00:01:59.420 --> 00:02:01.310
some facts about devil fruits.

00:02:01.310 --> 00:02:06.940
Okay, so baseline is: these fruits seem to
have been around for a long time and have

00:02:06.940 --> 00:02:10.079
become a regular part of the one piece world.

00:02:10.079 --> 00:02:14.629
While they are considered quite rare and special,
on the grand line, that attracts only the

00:02:14.629 --> 00:02:19.530
strongest and weirdest people, they are found
on a much more common basis.

00:02:19.530 --> 00:02:26.099
As Shanks explains, it is said that these
powers are all incarnation of a sea devil.

00:02:26.099 --> 00:02:28.200
And if you try to eat more than 1 fruit, the
two devils will start fighting, resulting

00:02:28.200 --> 00:02:35.420
in the death of the user.

00:02:35.420 --> 00:02:39.760
There are 3 types of devil fruits, each with
their own subcategories.

00:02:39.760 --> 00:02:42.269
Pineapple, Banana and orange.

00:02:42.269 --> 00:02:44.099
Just checking if you're still paying attention.

00:02:44.099 --> 00:02:48.129
Zoan fruits allow their users to transform
into an animal, giving them access to their

00:02:48.129 --> 00:02:53.230
regular form, their animal form as well as
a hybrid form.

00:02:53.230 --> 00:02:57.879
Subcategories include ancient Zoans for animals
that have gone extinct like dinosaurs, mythical

00:02:57.879 --> 00:03:03.230
Zoans that include mythical creatures like
the phoenix as well as a separation in herbivore

00:03:03.230 --> 00:03:09.730
and carnivore types, boosting endurance and
defense or speed and offense respectively.

00:03:09.730 --> 00:03:14.620
[chopper about lucci]

00:03:14.620 --> 00:03:16.090
Next are Logia fruits.

00:03:16.090 --> 00:03:18.280
They are pretty easy to summarize.

00:03:18.280 --> 00:03:24.249
As you know, a logia turns the body of its
user into an element, for example fire.

00:03:24.249 --> 00:03:26.909
Regular physical attacks are useless here.

00:03:26.909 --> 00:03:27.909
And this.

00:03:27.909 --> 00:03:32.559
Is little known, but Logia users actually
can enhance their powers significantly by

00:03:32.559 --> 00:03:37.500
subscribing to my channel for next generation
anime content.

00:03:37.500 --> 00:03:42.159
Paramecia fruits then are the dumping place
for all powers that don't fit in the other

00:03:42.159 --> 00:03:43.650
two categories.

00:03:43.650 --> 00:03:46.480
There are a lot of subcategories here.

00:03:46.480 --> 00:03:48.950
Some users can enhance their bodies.

00:03:48.950 --> 00:03:51.370
Luffy's enhancement is permanent.

00:03:51.370 --> 00:03:52.519
He's a rubber man.

00:03:52.519 --> 00:03:57.450
Mr. 1 for instance can transform his body
at will, while someone like brook only gets

00:03:57.450 --> 00:04:03.499
the effect of his fruit through a certain
event, in this case death.

00:04:03.499 --> 00:04:06.430
Other users are able to produce a power.

00:04:06.430 --> 00:04:11.930
Some can produce materials, like Doflamingo's
string, others can produce a force of nature,

00:04:11.930 --> 00:04:18.190
like Whitebeard, while again others can produce
entire worlds of their own, such as Mon't

00:04:18.190 --> 00:04:19.330
D'or or Brulee.

00:04:19.330 --> 00:04:23.390
Lastly, there are people who I guess basically
do magic.

00:04:23.390 --> 00:04:27.720
There is people like Sugar who can manipulate
living things, people who have control over

00:04:27.720 --> 00:04:37.970
a certain space, like Law or Corazon and some
even crazier powers like Big Mom's soul manipulation.

00:04:37.970 --> 00:04:42.440
In general, there are 4 known weaknesses to
devil fruit powers.

00:04:42.440 --> 00:04:46.220
First and maybe most dangerous, is losing
the ability to swim.

00:04:46.220 --> 00:04:51.940
If a user is submerged into water, they are
drained of all energy and incapable of moving

00:04:51.940 --> 00:04:53.820
or using their powers.

00:04:53.820 --> 00:05:00.380
Which in a world of pirates consisting to
99% of water is a pretty damn big handicap.

00:05:00.380 --> 00:05:04.250
Simply throwing a glass of water at them won't
work though - probably.

00:05:04.250 --> 00:05:09.470
The next best thing though is sea prism stone,
which is mined in Wano and comes with its

00:05:09.470 --> 00:05:19.230
own set of mystery of how its made and why
it works.

00:05:19.230 --> 00:05:24.070
The end result however is that this material
has the same essence of the ocean.

00:05:24.070 --> 00:05:29.600
Which is why it can be used to take out an
ability user even on land and without throwing

00:05:29.600 --> 00:05:31.310
that glass of water at them.

00:05:31.310 --> 00:05:32.880
Third is Haki.

00:05:32.880 --> 00:05:38.250
More specifically armament haki or as it's
called in French: Haki de l'Armement.

00:05:38.250 --> 00:05:39.250
Mon dieu.

00:05:39.250 --> 00:05:44.530
This can be used to forcibly turn a devil
fruit users body back into regular flesh and

00:05:44.530 --> 00:05:47.440
bones, no matter how it was transformed or
shaped.

00:05:47.440 --> 00:05:52.190
And I never really thought about it for some
reason, but isn't it really strange that Haki

00:05:52.190 --> 00:05:54.200
has this effect devil fruits?

00:05:54.200 --> 00:05:58.480
Well small tease here: This is gonna be one
of the details in which the devil will be

00:05:58.480 --> 00:05:59.480
found later.

00:05:59.480 --> 00:06:00.890
Better put on some pants devil!

00:06:00.890 --> 00:06:05.210
Lastly, and this will also play a role, there
is one devil fruit power out there that has

00:06:05.210 --> 00:06:11.480
the ability to absorb and nullify any other
power: Blackbeard's Yami-Yami no mi, that

00:06:11.480 --> 00:06:18.640
he calls the strongest logia out there.

00:06:18.640 --> 00:06:25.170
Finally, the most rescent thing we learned
is that devil fruits can be awakened.

00:06:25.170 --> 00:06:30.770
Basically, by mastering one's ability and
being able to fully control it at will, the

00:06:30.770 --> 00:06:37.310
user starts to unlock a new level of his fruit,
that in some way or form enhances its power

00:06:37.310 --> 00:06:38.360
and or reach.

00:06:38.360 --> 00:06:44.280
Zoan users generally get access to a giant,
monster-like hybrid form that boosts all their

00:06:44.280 --> 00:06:57.720
physical attributes and also let's them recover
very fast form even the most fatal attacks.

00:06:57.720 --> 00:07:02.510
Examples for this are the guards in impel
down, as well as most likely chopper's monster

00:07:02.510 --> 00:07:03.580
point.

00:07:03.580 --> 00:07:08.670
While we haven't seen a logia user officially
awaken, it is pretty safe to assume that such

00:07:08.670 --> 00:07:13.060
a power permanently changes the environment
around them.

00:07:13.060 --> 00:07:18.260
This is not only based on Doflamingo's explanation,
but also on how the landscape of punk hazard

00:07:18.260 --> 00:07:24.060
was permanently changed after the battle between
Aokiji and Akainu, as well as Raijin island,

00:07:24.060 --> 00:07:29.810
that suspiciously looks like someone went
a bit cray cray with Enel's fruit there.

00:07:29.810 --> 00:07:35.390
Lastly, we have the wide range of paramecia
users.

00:07:35.390 --> 00:07:40.360
While producers like Dofi, Kid and Katakuri
are able to change their environment as well

00:07:40.360 --> 00:07:45.139
as their body in their awakened state, someone
like law seems to get additional abilities

00:07:45.139 --> 00:07:48.930
for his fruit, like creating shockwaves inside
the body.

00:07:48.930 --> 00:07:55.380
And actually, I think there is a pretty good
chance that Luffy's awakening is already here.

00:07:55.380 --> 00:07:57.870
If you want me to talk about that as well,
let me know.

00:07:57.870 --> 00:08:02.050
So now that I had established all that we
knew about devil fruits and consumed 2 cups

00:08:02.050 --> 00:08:05.000
of coffee, it was time to go clue hunting.

00:08:05.000 --> 00:08:09.590
Okay, so there are a couple of things that
got me wondering about the true nature of

00:08:09.590 --> 00:08:13.710
devil fruits and if there wasn't more to all
of this.

00:08:13.710 --> 00:08:18.870
Without making it unnecessarily dramatic,
I was wondering whether devil fruits were

00:08:18.870 --> 00:08:21.050
in some weird way alive.

00:08:21.050 --> 00:08:29.720
While the talk of the sea devil residing in
the fruit might have seemed like casual sailor

00:08:29.720 --> 00:08:36.050
talk in early one piece, shanks turned out
to be one of the most well-informed and powerful

00:08:36.050 --> 00:08:41.950
people in the story, and I have already talked
about in other videos how Shanks most likely

00:08:41.950 --> 00:08:47.710
was not simply chilling around in the east
blue, but actively following Rogers orders

00:08:47.710 --> 00:08:50.030
to find the man he was waiting for.

00:08:50.030 --> 00:08:54.610
So my thesis statement is gonna be that this
explanation by shanks to buggy on board of

00:08:54.610 --> 00:08:56.930
roger's ship is literal.

00:08:56.930 --> 00:09:02.080
There resides a devil inside every fruit,
that is then transferred into the body of

00:09:02.080 --> 00:09:06.130
the person that consumes it and merges with
their soul.

00:09:06.130 --> 00:09:07.130
Let me try and proof it to you.

00:09:07.130 --> 00:09:08.130
By the way shoutout to all the people online
who have thought about this as well.

00:09:08.130 --> 00:09:09.130
I think I read through at least 20 blog posts
on this topic.

00:09:09.130 --> 00:09:11.380
First of all we have the incarnation of devil
fruit powers.

00:09:11.380 --> 00:09:17.010
When a fruit user dies, his ability is shown
to leave the body, like a soul, and travel

00:09:17.010 --> 00:09:19.510
to the nearest fruit of the same type.

00:09:19.510 --> 00:09:24.330
For example, smiley's zoan-type fruit would
always be an apple, which is why there can

00:09:24.330 --> 00:09:29.270
be a devil fruit encyclopedia in the first
place, that Blackbeard used to identify the

00:09:29.270 --> 00:09:39.090
Yami-Yami no mi.

00:09:39.090 --> 00:09:42.820
The soul leaves the host and finds it's next
container.

00:09:42.820 --> 00:09:47.180
Once someone takes a bite of this new fruit,
the devil enters the body and the rest of

00:09:47.180 --> 00:09:48.860
the fruit is useless.

00:09:48.860 --> 00:09:51.610
Except for vitamins, which are important.

00:09:51.610 --> 00:09:54.790
Basically, your soul and the soul of the devil
merge.

00:09:54.790 --> 00:09:59.930
On Enies Lobby, Jabra explains to us that
two devils would fight if you tried to consume

00:09:59.930 --> 00:10:03.260
a second fruit, killing the user in the process.

00:10:03.260 --> 00:10:08.750
The biggest evidence that devil fruits have
a will of their own however are Funkfreed,

00:10:08.750 --> 00:10:19.710
Smiley and the second best dog in one piece,
Lassoo.

00:10:19.710 --> 00:10:25.460
All three of them are objects, a sword, a
gas weapon and a gun that have gained consciousness,

00:10:25.460 --> 00:10:29.390
free will and the ability to turn into an
animal.

00:10:29.390 --> 00:10:35.460
The only explanation, is that the soul contained
in the devil fruit is transferred into the

00:10:35.460 --> 00:10:36.540
object.

00:10:36.540 --> 00:10:40.860
Pretty much the successful version of what
Caesar tried to do with the smiles.

00:10:40.860 --> 00:10:45.610
These objects now understand human speech
and even have a will of their own, as is shown

00:10:45.610 --> 00:10:49.190
in this scene here.

00:10:49.190 --> 00:10:50.190
[]

00:10:50.190 --> 00:10:59.250
And if their own will, that also gives us
an answer as to why devil fruits have their

00:10:59.250 --> 00:11:00.820
respective weaknesses.

00:11:00.820 --> 00:11:07.200
If the sea devil grants these powers, he would
take them back, once you sink into him.

00:11:07.200 --> 00:11:11.860
His will is stronger than yours and that of
your smaller devil.

00:11:11.860 --> 00:11:17.130
Similarly, Haki is able to overcome a fruit,
not because it overcomes the haki of the owner,

00:11:17.130 --> 00:11:19.730
but of the devil fruit itself.

00:11:19.730 --> 00:11:23.920
Otherwise, every-time someone tried to use
haki on another user, they would be stuck

00:11:23.920 --> 00:11:28.290
in limbo fighting it out for a while before
they could actually forcibly change their

00:11:28.290 --> 00:11:29.420
bodies back.

00:11:29.420 --> 00:11:34.920
As for Blackbeard: If his devil fruit truly
is the strongest devil fruit, and I have to

00:11:34.920 --> 00:11:39.240
admit the darkness fruit seems like the most
devilish one there is, that would mean that

00:11:39.240 --> 00:11:45.330
the devil in his fruit is stronger than any
other devil, and that it nullifies their abilities

00:11:45.330 --> 00:11:47.370
in the same way.

00:11:47.370 --> 00:11:50.540
Awakening your devil fruit then could be a
quite literal phrase.

00:11:50.540 --> 00:11:53.690
When you are under water your devil is asleep.

00:11:53.690 --> 00:11:58.610
In your everyday state, the devil is in something
of a dream-state, sharing their abilities.

00:11:58.610 --> 00:12:03.060
But when you awaken, the full potential of
the fruit is unleashed.

00:12:03.060 --> 00:12:07.839
Wish the awakening, the devil part of your
soul would of course become stronger, which

00:12:07.839 --> 00:12:13.160
is exactly what we see in the prison guards
