00:12:13.160 --> 00:12:20.900
They are more animal than human, just as with
chopper, who has to train hard to get control

00:12:20.900 --> 00:12:22.360
over this state.

00:12:22.360 --> 00:12:26.550
People like Doflamingo and Katakuri clearly
