00:12:26.550 --> 00:12:31.910
the awakened fruits we know cause are incredibly
destructive to their surroundings and are

00:12:31.910 --> 00:12:32.910
hard to keep in check.

00:12:32.910 --> 00:12:33.910
And they also require an enormous amount of
energy.

00:12:33.910 --> 00:12:47.400
You literally are fighting with the devil
over control.

00:12:47.400 --> 00:12:53.279
Seeing how kid and law struggle with it, conqueror's
haki might well be an advantage in dealing

00:12:53.279 --> 00:12:54.790
with this state.

00:12:54.790 --> 00:12:59.480
Doflamingo and Katakuri after all, both were
able to use their awakening quite creatively

00:12:59.480 --> 00:13:02.920
