than we actually thought.

00:17:16.110 --> 00:17:21.230
It was stolen and protected by shanks, who
got into a conflict with the world government

00:17:21.230 --> 00:17:22.230
about it.

00:17:22.230 --> 00:17:27.660
Now, I have always hated the idea that Roger
had ate the Gomu Gomu no mi as well.

00:17:27.660 --> 00:17:34.090
But looking at it though this lense, what
if he had and Luffy took on some of Roger's

00:17:34.090 --> 00:17:36.059
personality traits?

00:17:36.059 --> 00:17:41.929
So many characters draw parallels between
Luffy and Roger, down to Luffy saying the

00:17:41.929 --> 00:17:53.670
exact same things as the first pirate king.

00:17:53.670 --> 00:17:57.559
Luffy's reaction at his execution in Logue
town: Roger.

00:17:57.559 --> 00:18:01.180
Luffy's reason to look for the one piece:
Roger.

00:18:01.180 --> 00:18:06.210
And its only after Luffy eats the gomu gomu
no mi that he declares his dream to become

00:18:06.210 --> 00:18:13.830
pirate king for the first time to shanks,
upon which he gives him roger's old hat.

00:18:13.830 --> 00:18:23.380
Now, if this were true shouldn't we already
know that Roger had the same fruit as luffy?

00:18:23.380 --> 00:18:25.929
That should be common knowledge after all.

00:18:25.929 --> 00:18:28.679
But what if this was actually joy boy's fruit?

00:18:28.679 --> 00:18:34.840
Now this is admittedly speculation, but what
if Roger found this fruit on Laugh tale, consumed

00:18:34.840 --> 00:18:40.720
it, inherited Joy Boy's will and died a little
later without most people ever knowing?

00:18:40.720 --> 00:18:44.890
For his execution, as we know, knives still
work on Luffy.

00:18:44.890 --> 00:18:50.340
Wouldn't it make a lot of sense if this was
the true reason this fruit was special?

00:18:50.340 --> 00:18:57.100
Not because it has some secret rubber power,
but because it has Joy Boy's and Roger's inherited

00:18:57.100 --> 00:18:58.420
will in it?

00:18:58.420 --> 00:19:03.810
And remember Roger's last words to Rayleigh.

00:19:03.810 --> 00:19:10.130
[] He literally remembers them after meeting
Luffy.

00:19:10.130 --> 00:19:15.510
Now this theory is based on a lot of analysis,
but if you want something even bigger, I suggest

00:19:15.510 --> 00:19:18.590
you check out the best one piece theory ever,
right here.

